        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "[V2G20-2051] When a TLS session is terminated due to a V2G session being paused, the SECC shall irretrievably erase/delete/destroy all cryptographic data calculated for that particular TLS session. This includes all keys calculated for TLS encryption, any data calculated for certificate validation, etc.",
            "block_bbox": [
